# Dependencies (none are committed; the app has no build step)
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# package.json is a local tooling aid only (its "type": "module" lets Node
# syntax-check the ES modules; `npm start` serves the folder). The app is a
# no-build static site, so nothing in deployment reads it — kept out of the
# public repo to avoid a second place the name/version could drift.
package.json

